  "rationale": "Use a simple capability plant plus a compact policy specification. The specification separates clear exploration from obstacle recovery, respects uncontrollable-first runtime semantics by self-looping path_clear in commit/recovery states, forbids forward/random motion in obstacle states, and returns quickly to exploration after recovery. Random walk is the default in clear exploration, with a short forward pulse used in a dedicated progress state to bias coverage without long unsafe forward streaks.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model sensing and motion capability in a permissive plant with all events available and deterministic self-loops.",
    "Encode the exploration policy in one deterministic specification with one-shot commit states and obstacle-specific recovery states."
